#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete all the Port to MAC to IP results from the system?"
msgstr "Je, una uhakika unataka kufuta matokeo yote ya Bandari kwa MAC kwa IP kutoka kwa mfumo?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete the expired Port to MAC to IP results now?"
msgstr "Je, una uhakika unataka kufuta matokeo ya Bandari kwa MAC kwa IP yaliyoisha muda wake sasa?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to purge the cached Mactrack scanning functions?"
msgstr "Je, una uhakika unataka kusafisha vitendakazi vya uchanganuzi vya Mactrack vilivyohifadhiwa kwenye akiba?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete all the Aggregated Port to MAC to IP results from the system?"
msgstr "Je, una uhakika unataka kufuta matokeo yote ya Bandari Iliyounganishwa kwa MAC kwa IP kutoka kwa mfumo?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to delete and recreate all the Aggregated Port to MAC to IP results from the system?"
msgstr "Je, una uhakika unataka kufuta na kuunda upya matokeo yote ya Bandari Iliyounganishwa kwa MAC kwa IP kutoka kwa mfumo?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to download and import the IEEE Vendor MAC/OUI database now?"
msgstr "Je, una uhakika unataka kupakua na kuingiza hifadhidata ya IEEE Vendor MAC/OUI sasa?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to rebuild the scan date list from the stored Port to MAC to IP results now?"
msgstr "Je, una uhakika unataka kuunda upya orodha ya tarehe za uchanganuzi kutoka kwa matokeo ya Lango hadi MAC hadi IP yaliyohifadhiwa sasa?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Rebuild and analyze the partition containing the latest port observation, which is the current week with weekly partitions. An unpartitioned table is optimized in full. Scheduled scans are skipped while this runs. Continue?"
msgstr "Jenga upya na uchanganue sehemu iliyo na uchunguzi wa hivi karibuni zaidi wa mlango, ambao ni wiki ya sasa kwa sehemu za kila wiki. Jedwali lisilo na sehemu huboreshwa kikamilifu. Uchanganuzi uliopangwa hurukwa wakati hili linaendelea. Endelea?"

#: lib/mactrack_functions.php
msgid "Run this maintenance off hours. The rebuild copies the full history of the port (MAC address), IP address and 802.1x tables one after the other and can take hours. Scheduled scans are skipped, database maintenance waits, and MAC, IP and 802.1x searching shows a maintenance message until it finishes. Allow free disk space for a second copy of each table and its indexes. Continue?"
msgstr "Endesha matengenezo haya nje ya saa za kazi. Ujenzi upya unanakili historia kamili ya majedwali ya mlango (anwani ya MAC), anwani ya IP na 802.1x moja baada ya nyingine na unaweza kuchukua saa kadhaa. Uchanganuzi ulioratibiwa unarukwa, matengenezo ya hifadhidata yanasubiri, na utafutaji wa MAC, IP na 802.1x unaonyesha ujumbe wa matengenezo hadi ukamilike. Acha nafasi huru ya diski kwa ajili ya nakala ya pili ya kila jedwali na faharasa zake. Endelea?"

