#: lib/mactrack_partition_rebuild.php
msgid "The port, IP and 802.1x tables are being repartitioned, or a rebuild did not finish, so their history cannot be changed now. Try again when cli/upgrade_partitioning.php has finished."
msgstr "Majedwali ya mlango, IP na 802.1x yanagawanywa upya, au ujenzi upya haukumalizika, kwa hivyo historia yake haiwezi kubadilishwa sasa. Jaribu tena wakati cli/upgrade_partitioning.php imekamilika."

#: lib/mactrack_partition_rebuild.php
msgid "MacTrack is in maintenance mode for IP address, MAC address and 802.1x searching while its history tables are repartitioned. Results are incomplete until the partitioning has finished."
msgstr "MacTrack iko katika hali ya matengenezo kwa utafutaji wa anwani ya IP, anwani ya MAC na 802.1x huku majedwali yake ya historia yakigawanywa upya. Matokeo hayajakamilika hadi ugawaji utakapokamilika."

#: lib/mactrack_partition_rebuild.php
msgid "MacTrack is in maintenance mode for IP address, MAC address and 802.1x searching because the partitioning of its history tables did not finish. Results are incomplete. Run cli/upgrade_partitioning.php again to resume it."
msgstr "MacTrack iko katika hali ya matengenezo kwa utafutaji wa anwani ya IP, anwani ya MAC na 802.1x kwa sababu ugawaji wa majedwali yake ya historia haukukamilika. Matokeo hayajakamilika. Endesha cli/upgrade_partitioning.php tena ili kuendelea nao."

#: lib/mactrack_partition_rebuild.php
msgid "Maintenance Mode"
msgstr "Hali ya Matengenezo"

