#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "This option will let you show and set process information associated with the Mactrack polling process."
msgstr "Chaguo hili litakuruhusu kuonyesha na kuweka maelezo ya mchakato yanayohusiana na mchakato wa ukusanyaji wa Mactrack."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Database Administration"
msgstr "Usimamizi wa Hifadhidata"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes expired Port to MAC to IP associations from the database.  Only records that have expired, based upon your criteria are removed."
msgstr "Hufuta miunganisho ya Mlango hadi MAC hadi IP iliyoisha muda wake kutoka kwenye hifadhidata.  Rekodi zilizoisha muda wake pekee, kulingana na vigezo vyako, ndizo huondolewa."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Refresh IEEE Vendor MAC/OUI Database"
msgstr "Onyesha Upya Hifadhidata ya MAC/OUI ya Wauzaji ya IEEE"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "This function will download and install the latest OIU database from the IEEE Website.  Each Network Interface Card (NIC) has a MAC Address.  The MAC Address can be broken into two parts.  The first part of the MAC Address contains the Vendor MAC.  The Vendor MAC identifies who manufactured the part.  This will be helpful in spot checking for rogue devices on your network."
msgstr "Kitendakazi hiki kitapakua na kusakinisha hifadhidata ya hivi punde ya OIU kutoka kwenye Tovuti ya IEEE.  Kila Kadi ya Kiolesura cha Mtandao (NIC) ina Anwani ya MAC.  Anwani ya MAC inaweza kugawanywa katika sehemu mbili.  Sehemu ya kwanza ya Anwani ya MAC ina MAC ya Mchuuzi.  MAC ya Mchuuzi hubainisha ni nani aliyetengeneza kifaa hicho.  Hii itasaidia katika ukaguzi wa haraka wa vifaa visivyoruhusiwa kwenye mtandao wako."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes old and potentially stale Mactrack scanning functions from the drop-down you receive when you edit a device type."
msgstr "Hufuta vitendakazi vya zamani na vinavyoweza kuwa vimepitwa na wakati vya uchanganuzi wa Mactrack kutoka kwenye orodha kunjuzi unayopokea unapohariri aina ya kifaa."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes <strong>ALL</strong> Port to MAC to IP associations from the database all IP Addresses, IP Ranges, and VLANS.  This utility is good when you want to start over.  <strong>DANGER: All prior data is deleted.</strong>"
msgstr "Hufuta miunganisho <strong>YOTE</strong> ya Mlango hadi MAC hadi IP kutoka kwenye hifadhidata, Anwani zote za IP, Masafa ya IP, na VLAN.  Zana hii ni nzuri unapotaka kuanza upya.  <strong>HATARI: Data yote ya awali hufutwa.</strong>"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Rebuilds the list of scan dates from the stored Port to MAC to IP results, reading each partition once. Scans and maintenance keep the list current, so this is only needed after results were removed outside of maintenance, for example by deleting devices."
msgstr "Hujenga upya orodha ya tarehe za uchanganuzi kutoka kwa matokeo yaliyohifadhiwa ya Mlango hadi MAC hadi IP, ikisoma kila sehemu mara moja. Uchanganuzi na matengenezo huiweka orodha katika hali ya sasa, kwa hivyo hii inahitajika tu baada ya matokeo kuondolewa nje ya matengenezo, kwa mfano kwa kufuta vifaa."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "View Partition Status"
msgstr "Tazama Hali ya Sehemu"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Shows how the Port to MAC to IP results are partitioned, the partition size in use and why, and what the last database maintenance did."
msgstr "Huonyesha jinsi matokeo ya Mlango hadi MAC hadi IP yalivyogawanywa, ukubwa wa sehemu unaotumika na sababu, na kile ambacho matengenezo ya mwisho ya hifadhidata yalifanya."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Rebuilds and analyzes only the partition containing the latest port observation to reclaim deleted space; with weekly partitions that is the current week. Unpartitioned tables are optimized in full. Scheduled scans are skipped until it finishes."
msgstr "Hujenga upya na kuchanganua sehemu iliyo na uchunguzi wa hivi karibuni zaidi wa mlango pekee ili kurejesha nafasi iliyofutwa; kwa sehemu za kila wiki hiyo ni wiki ya sasa. Majedwali yasiyo na sehemu huboreshwa kikamilifu. Uchanganuzi uliopangwa hurukwa hadi ikamilike."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Choose daily or weekly partitions, or disable partitioning, for the port (MAC address), IP address and 802.1x tables. The rebuild copies the full history in the background; scheduled scans are skipped and MAC, IP and 802.1x searching shows a maintenance message meanwhile."
msgstr "Chagua vigawanyo vya kila siku au kila wiki, au zima ugawanyaji, kwa lango (anwani ya MAC), anwani ya IP na majedwali ya 802.1x. Ujenzi upya unanakili historia yote chinichini; uchunguzi ulioratibiwa unarukwa na utafutaji wa MAC, IP na 802.1x unaonyesha ujumbe wa matengenezo kwa muda huo."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Aggregated Table Administration"
msgstr "Usimamizi wa Jedwali Zilizokusanywa"

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes ALL <strong>Aggregated</strong> (Not Scan Results) Port to MAC to IP associations from the database.  Data will again be collected on the basis of <strong>only new</strong> scanned data in the next mactrack poller run."
msgstr "Hufuta miunganisho YOTE <strong>Iliyokusanywa kwa Pamoja</strong> (Siyo Matokeo ya Uchanganuzi) ya Mlango hadi MAC hadi IP kutoka kwenye hifadhidata.  Data itakusanywa tena kwa msingi wa data <strong>mpya pekee</strong> iliyochanganuliwa katika uendeshaji ujao wa kikusanyaji cha mactrack."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Deletes ALL <strong>Aggregated</strong> (Not Scan Results) Port to MAC to IP associations from the database and their re-creation based on <strong>All scanned data</strong> now."
msgstr "Hufuta miunganisho YOTE <strong>Iliyokusanywa kwa Pamoja</strong> (Siyo Matokeo ya Uchanganuzi) ya Mlango hadi MAC hadi IP kutoka kwenye hifadhidata na kuiunda upya kulingana na <strong>Data yote iliyochanganuliwa</strong> sasa."

#: mactrack_utilities.php
msgid "Partitioning"
msgstr "Ugawanyaji wa sehemu"

