#: setup.php
msgid "Disable Device"
msgstr "Zima Kifaa"

#: setup.php
msgid "Check this box to disable all checks for this host."
msgstr "Tiki kisanduku hiki ili kuzima ukaguzi wote wa kipangishi hiki."

#: setup.php
msgid "Switch/Hub, Switch/Router Settings"
msgstr "Mipangilio ya Swichi/Kitovu, Swichi/Ruta"

#: setup.php
msgid "Provide a list of ports on a specific switch/hub whose MAC results should be ignored.  Ports such as link/trunk ports that can not be distinguished from other user ports are examples.  Each port number must be separated by a colon, pipe, or a space ':', '|', ' '.  For example, 'Fa0/1: Fa1/23' or 'Fa0/1 Fa1/23' would be acceptable for some manufacturers switch types."
msgstr "Toa orodha ya milango kwenye swichi/kitovu mahususi ambayo matokeo yake ya MAC yanapaswa kupuuzwa.  Milango kama vile milango ya kiungo/shina ambayo haiwezi kutofautishwa na milango mingine ya watumiaji ni mifano.  Kila nambari ya mlango lazima itenganishwe kwa nukta pacha, mstari wima, au nafasi ':', '|', ' '.  Kwa mfano, 'Fa0/1: Fa1/23' au 'Fa0/1 Fa1/23' itakubalika kwa aina za swichi za baadhi ya watengenezaji."

#: setup.php
msgid "You can use specific SNMP settings or select SNMP set. In the second case, mactrack tries to find correct settings from SNMP set"
msgstr "Unaweza kutumia mipangilio mahususi ya SNMP au kuchagua seti ya SNMP. Katika hali ya pili, mactrack hujaribu kupata mipangilio sahihi kutoka kwa seti ya SNMP"

#: setup.php
