#: setup.php
msgid "General Mac Address Tracking Settings"
msgstr "Mipangilio ya Jumla ya Ufuatiliaji wa Anwani ya MAC"

#: setup.php
msgid "MAC Address"
msgstr "Anwani ya MAC"

#: setup.php
msgid "Please enter the MAC Address to be watched for."
msgstr "Tafadhali ingiza Anwani ya MAC itakayofuatiliwa."

#: setup.php
msgid "MAC Tracking Name/Email Subject"
msgstr "Jina la Ufuatiliaji wa MAC/Mada ya Barua Pepe"

#: setup.php
msgid "Please enter a reasonable name for this MAC Tracking entry.  This information will be in the subject line of your Email"
msgstr "Tafadhali ingiza jina linalofaa kwa ingizo hili la Ufuatiliaji wa MAC. Taarifa hii itakuwa kwenye mstari wa mada wa Barua Pepe yako"

#: setup.php
msgid "Ticket number for cross referencing with your corporate help desk system(s)."
msgstr "Nambari ya tiketi kwa ajili ya marejeleo ya pamoja na mfumo/mifumo yako ya dawati la msaada la shirika."

#: setup.php
msgid "Notification Schedule"
msgstr "Ratiba ya Arifa"

#: setup.php
msgid "Choose how often an Email should be generated for this Mac Watch item."
msgstr "Chagua ni mara ngapi Barua Pepe inapaswa kutolewa kwa kipengee hiki cha Mac Watch."

#: setup.php
msgid "First Occurrence Only"
msgstr "Tukio la Kwanza Pekee"

#: setup.php
msgid "All Occurrences"
msgstr "Matukio Yote"

#: setup.php
msgid "Every Hour"
msgstr "Kila Saa"

#: setup.php
msgid "Email Addresses"
msgstr "Anwani za Barua Pepe"

#: setup.php
msgid "Enter a semicolon separated of Email addresses that will be notified where this MAC address is."
msgstr "Ingiza orodha ya anwani za Barua Pepe zilizotenganishwa kwa nukta-mkato zitakazoarifiwa mahali ilipo anwani hii ya MAC."

#: setup.php
msgid "General Mac Address Authorization Settings"
msgstr "Mipangilio ya Jumla ya Uidhinishaji wa Anwani ya MAC"

#: setup.php
msgid "MAC Address Match"
msgstr "Ulinganifu wa Anwani ya MAC"

#: setup.php
msgid "Please enter the MAC Address or Mac Address Match string to be automatically authorized.  If you wish to authorize a group of MAC Addresses, you can use the wildcard character of '&#37;' anywhere in the MAC Address."
msgstr "Tafadhali ingiza Anwani ya MAC au mfuatano wa Kulinganisha Anwani ya MAC ili kuidhinishwa kiotomatiki. Iwapo unataka kuidhinisha kundi la Anwani za MAC, unaweza kutumia herufi badala ya '&#37;' popote katika Anwani ya MAC."

#: setup.php
msgid "Please add a reason for this entry."
msgstr "Tafadhali ongeza sababu ya ingizo hili."

